<title>TAIWAN: TSMC Jan-Sept profits 60.4 pct up.</title>
<headline>TSMC Jan-Sept profits 60.4 pct up.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>January-September 1996</p>
<p>			 (in million T$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover			    31,173 vs 20,065</p>
<p>    Net profit			  16,021 vs  9,988</p>
<p>Note - Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing Co is Taiwan's largest semiconductor maker.</p>
<p>A company statement said that due to the firm's advanced research and cost-control ability, sales in the first three quarters had reached 80.65 percent of the target for all of 1996 while profits had reached 85.11 percent.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
